{
  "id": "the-blood-moone-files",
  "title": "The Blood & Moone files",
  "subtitle": "Hosted by Dog Boy Dan",
  "description": "In the heart of Appalachia, monsters don’t just haunt the woods — they walk Main Street. When small-town constable Chandler Blood bonds with a demon in his head, he gains visions of trouble before it strikes. Unfortunately, trouble arrives in the form of his long-missing best friend, John Moone — now a monster hunter for a secretive corporate agency. Together, they stumble into a web of supernatural threats and small-town secrets that could tear their community apart. From redneck vampires and fire demons to eccentric forest wizards and a corrupt sheriff hungry for power , The Blood & Moone Files blends Appalachian small town setting, buddy-comedy banter, and creeping mystery into a serialized audio drama. This indie series delivers equal parts humor, horror, and heart — where loyalty is tested, magic is dangerous, and the monsters aren’t always the ones in the woods. 🎧 New episodes coming soon. Listen anywhere you get your podcasts. Hosted on Acast. See acast.com/privacy for more information.",
